  m_Name: L1307_ConsumingTooManyItems
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 07
  exerciseName: ConsumingTooManyItems
  exerciseTitle: Consuming too many items
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458729
  exerciseText: Crafting is consuming too many items
  hintText: Check all the places where the original list is being modified
  solutionText: "The code is consuming items from the itemSOList when checking if
    has item, but that function should only test if the items exist in the list,
    it should not be removing them.\nIt should have a clone and modify that instead\nList<ItemSO>
    cloneItemSOList = new List<ItemSO>(itemSOList);\r\nforeach (ItemSO itemSO in
    testItemSOList) {\r\n    if (cloneItemSOList.Contains(itemSO)) {\r\n        cloneItemSOList.Remove(itemSO);\r\n   
    } else {\r\n        // Does not contain\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n}"
